{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "dgolqxcfezzsqozb", "title": "71.多语言模型的对齐与融合策略", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"83d4d33c\" id=\"83d4d33c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2d25f7f5\" id=\"u2d25f7f5\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u436dd98f\" id=\"u436dd98f\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752481808822-cc768b1e-3b25-443d-bf4c-5a285e9f5ffa.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22udef08531-beaf-4958-9469-ff0a4ebfe88%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue922a53b-b31c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A519.3333333333334%2C%22height%22%3A208%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A37903%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A779%2C%22originHeight%22%3A312%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%AD%94%E9%A2%98%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A152%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%22%2C%22x%22%3A605%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%84%E4%BC%B0%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A604%2C%22y%22%3A257%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A154%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E7%BB%93%E5%90%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A603%2C%22y%22%3A188%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A603%2C%22y%22%3A119%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u7a31001b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u21ae7437\" id=\"u21ae7437\"><span data-lake-id=\"u854c5c18\" id=\"u854c5c18\">在面试中回答“多语言模型的对齐与融合策略”时，需围绕以下核心逻辑展开：</span></p><ol list=\"u765389d9\"><li fid=\"ucb6c10fa\" data-lake-id=\"u99db16ef\" id=\"u99db16ef\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc9800b22\" id=\"uc9800b22\">问题定义</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3801b85b\" id=\"u3801b85b\">：明确多语言对齐（Alignment）与融合（Fusion）的目标，即如何让模型理解不同语言的语义关联，并整合多语言数据提升性能。</span></li><li fid=\"ucb6c10fa\" data-lake-id=\"u0a0a4e8c\" id=\"u0a0a4e8c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7220b365\" id=\"u7220b365\">技术框架</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2135042f\" id=\"u2135042f\">： </span></li></ol><ul list=\"u23a931a5\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u7b0b8753\" data-lake-id=\"u3daa9548\" id=\"u3daa9548\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub22593c7\" id=\"ub22593c7\">数据层面</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u80252d70\" id=\"u80252d70\">：如何构建多语言数据集，解决数据稀缺与分布不均衡问题。</span></li><li fid=\"u7b0b8753\" data-lake-id=\"u54c7d96d\" id=\"u54c7d96d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufe38c7a9\" id=\"ufe38c7a9\">模型架构</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc4498435\" id=\"uc4498435\">：选择单模型多语言（如mBERT/XLM）还是多模型融合（如Ensemble）。</span></li><li fid=\"u7b0b8753\" data-lake-id=\"u945f34c2\" id=\"u945f34c2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u72439ccb\" id=\"u72439ccb\">对齐策略</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u30c379f5\" id=\"u30c379f5\">：跨语言词嵌入、双语词典引导、对比学习等。</span></li><li fid=\"u7b0b8753\" data-lake-id=\"u8fce12ff\" id=\"u8fce12ff\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub46c6cf9\" id=\"ub46c6cf9\">融合策略</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u945c68f5\" id=\"u945c68f5\">：知识蒸馏、多任务学习、参数共享等。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u765389d9\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"ucb6c10fa\" data-lake-id=\"ub92838b2\" id=\"ub92838b2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua149b978\" id=\"ua149b978\">案例结合</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9fd374c7\" id=\"u9fd374c7\">：通过真实项目（如跨语言电商推荐系统）说明技术落地中的挑战与解决方案。</span></li><li fid=\"ucb6c10fa\" data-lake-id=\"ub0df54b1\" id=\"ub0df54b1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u70d4cd38\" id=\"u70d4cd38\">评估与优化</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubbe6b28d\" id=\"ubbe6b28d\">：如何验证模型效果（如BLEU、准确率），以及迭代改进方向。</span></li></ol><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cLp42%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"6c12541a\" id=\"6c12541a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b04f0b9\" id=\"u7b04f0b9\">二、项目案例</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ucaf82a7f\" id=\"ucaf82a7f\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752481822137-d8567549-a4ff-4cc1-a02f-a0f17d1ab4ad.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ufc1a3701-ce5d-410e-9745-6a24eef8dcd%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue922a53b-b31c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A477.3333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A141%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A26136%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A716%2C%22originHeight%22%3A212%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%86%B7%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E9%9A%BE%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A161%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%AD%E4%B9%89%E9%B8%BF%E6%B2%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A576%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%E7%97%9B%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A302%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%A8%80%E7%96%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A576%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A26%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua7423341%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"f6ca552a\" id=\"f6ca552a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4be481b\" id=\"uf4be481b\">案例背景：跨境电商多语言商品推荐系统</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u20136195\" id=\"u20136195\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub007288a\" id=\"ub007288a\">场景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u81aa415d\" id=\"u81aa415d\">：某跨境电商平台需为全球用户（英语、法语、西班牙语、中文）提供个性化商品推荐。由于用户行为数据分散在不同语言区域，且部分小语种数据量不足，导致推荐系统在非英语场景效果差。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8ea8098f\" id=\"u8ea8098f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u97bca2ea\" id=\"u97bca2ea\">痛点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub6634f69\" id=\"ub6634f69\">：</span></p><ol list=\"uf5257c62\"><li fid=\"u366fb514\" data-lake-id=\"u61a3ea44\" id=\"u61a3ea44\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue1f086c4\" id=\"ue1f086c4\">数据稀疏性</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u88355703\" id=\"u88355703\">：小语种（如法语、西班牙语）用户行为数据量仅为英语的1/5。</span></li><li fid=\"u366fb514\" data-lake-id=\"uc91f6e24\" id=\"uc91f6e24\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue23fd35d\" id=\"ue23fd35d\">语义鸿沟</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7d2173fd\" id=\"u7d2173fd\">：不同语言用户对同一商品的描述差异大（如“运动鞋”在法语中为“chaussures de sport”）。</span></li><li fid=\"u366fb514\" data-lake-id=\"u74280600\" id=\"u74280600\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc750d768\" id=\"uc750d768\">冷启动问题</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8f6f0ab7\" id=\"u8f6f0ab7\">：新上线的小语种地区缺乏历史数据，难以初始化推荐模型。</span></li></ol><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bVOZq%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"bd6c56ad\" id=\"bd6c56ad\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf0a4b14d\" id=\"uf0a4b14d\">三、参考回答</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ue9f1a909\" id=\"ue9f1a909\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752481851786-88ef57ff-cb00-4d2b-afb8-e489af0bf52b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9a8fbc2f-8dba-48fe-934d-c5a17b8e87b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue922a53b-b31c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A489.3333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A274%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A60244%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A734%2C%22originHeight%22%3A411%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%22%2C%22x%22%3A581%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91%22%2C%22x%22%3A581%2C%22y%22%3A362%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%84%E4%BC%B0%E6%8C%87%E6%A0%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A579%2C%22y%22%3A294%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E5%9B%9E%E7%AD%94%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A188%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AF%B9%E9%BD%90%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A305%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A306%2C%22y%22%3A189%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A305%2C%22y%22%3A328%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E9%80%89%E5%9E%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A581%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E9%80%89%E5%9E%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A581%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%22%2C%22x%22%3A582%2C%22y%22%3A86%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u63b7dbb9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"bf72aba8\" id=\"bf72aba8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua7e7cd24\" id=\"ua7e7cd24\">1. 多语言对齐策略</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u10906006\" id=\"u10906006\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4a9dbd6d\" id=\"u4a9dbd6d\">技术选型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u332875f1\" id=\"u332875f1\">：</span></p><ul list=\"u30e15494\"><li fid=\"uf22a8058\" data-lake-id=\"ued0c80f2\" id=\"ued0c80f2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3b421a15\" id=\"u3b421a15\">跨语言词嵌入（Cross-lingual Embedding）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5ad71045\" id=\"u5ad71045\"><br />使用FastText训练多语言词向量，通过双语词典（如英语-法语）对齐词向量空间，确保“apple”和“pomme”在向量空间中距离接近。</span></li><li fid=\"uf22a8058\" data-lake-id=\"uf0906910\" id=\"uf0906910\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u977e80d1\" id=\"u977e80d1\">对比学习（Contrastive Learning）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc591b2c2\" id=\"uc591b2c2\"><br />设计双语句子对（如英语商品描述与对应法语翻译），通过对比损失（Contrastive Loss）迫使模型学习跨语言语义相似性。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u13a0e9bc\" id=\"u13a0e9bc\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u24403beb\" id=\"u24403beb\">实施步骤</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7a3c9b4f\" id=\"u7a3c9b4f\">：</span></p><ol list=\"ufdd2f7cc\"><li fid=\"u3cd57fe4\" data-lake-id=\"ue2d4cce9\" id=\"ue2d4cce9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u925134cd\" id=\"u925134cd\">数据预处理</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud0dc4270\" id=\"ud0dc4270\">： </span></li></ol><ul list=\"u1dd99031\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u91f5e212\" data-lake-id=\"u440816fa\" id=\"u440816fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47181436\" id=\"u47181436\">收集英语商品描述（1M条）及对应法语、西班牙语翻译（各200k条）。</span></li><li fid=\"u91f5e212\" data-lake-id=\"u9a17c956\" id=\"u9a17c956\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b3bf732\" id=\"u4b3bf732\">清洗数据，去除重复和低质量样本。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"ufdd2f7cc\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u3cd57fe4\" data-lake-id=\"ufa7e8d59\" id=\"ufa7e8d59\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uba090df4\" id=\"uba090df4\">模型训练</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0f3a139d\" id=\"u0f3a139d\">： </span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8HuggingFace%E5%BA%93%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD%E5%A4%9A%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80BERT%20%20%5Cnfrom%20transformers%20import%20BertTokenizer%2C%20BertModel%20%20%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20BertTokenizer.from_pretrained('bert-base-multilingual-cased')%20%20%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20BertModel.from_pretrained('bert-base-multilingual-cased')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j4Znl%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u6c2323fc\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u51475d7a\" data-lake-id=\"u3c6639fc\" id=\"u3c6639fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa582649\" id=\"uaa582649\">冻结BERT底层参数，仅训练顶层分类层，输入双语句子对，输出跨语言语义表示。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"ufdd2f7cc\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u3cd57fe4\" data-lake-id=\"uf734f9ac\" id=\"uf734f9ac\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1b087774\" id=\"u1b087774\">对齐优化</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc0ec279c\" id=\"uc0ec279c\">： </span></li></ol><ul list=\"uf957e411\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ud53b1919\" data-lake-id=\"u4477c79f\" id=\"u4477c79f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80216d47\" id=\"u80216d47\">计算英语与法语词向量的余弦相似度，通过调整模型参数使相似词对齐。</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"91adbfdc\" id=\"91adbfdc\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u08a4745e\" id=\"u08a4745e\">2. 多语言融合策略</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ufa35e9e2\" id=\"ufa35e9e2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ude80754e\" id=\"ude80754e\">技术选型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5c94d472\" id=\"u5c94d472\">：</span></p><ul list=\"ufdc6869b\"><li fid=\"uc059ddfc\" data-lake-id=\"uabec1395\" id=\"uabec1395\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u62246509\" id=\"u62246509\">多任务学习（Multi-task Learning）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uedfc4570\" id=\"uedfc4570\"><br />共享底层语言模型参数，为每个语言构建独立的推荐任务头（Task Head），联合训练提升模型泛化能力。</span></li><li fid=\"uc059ddfc\" data-lake-id=\"u26afaafb\" id=\"u26afaafb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u695a7165\" id=\"u695a7165\">知识蒸馏（Knowledge Distillation）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u07e31cd0\" id=\"u07e31cd0\"> 使用英语大模型（Teacher）生成伪标签，指导小语种模型（Student）学习。 </span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u958f8ec0\" id=\"u958f8ec0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u020ad9ec\" id=\"u020ad9ec\">实施步骤</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u42cb5a41\" id=\"u42cb5a41\">：</span></p><ol list=\"u53154858\"><li fid=\"ue9ddabf6\" data-lake-id=\"ud9983284\" id=\"ud9983284\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue14bcce0\" id=\"ue14bcce0\">任务划分</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u509ce9f9\" id=\"u509ce9f9\">： </span></li></ol><ul list=\"ubcd39e99\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u52c7a1ba\" data-lake-id=\"u179a7eb8\" id=\"u179a7eb8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uffa5dc27\" id=\"uffa5dc27\">主任务：跨语言商品推荐（英语、法语、西班牙语）。</span></li><li fid=\"u52c7a1ba\" data-lake-id=\"ud9ddf1eb\" id=\"ud9ddf1eb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0dec8d3\" id=\"ua0dec8d3\">辅助任务：语言无关的用户行为建模（如点击率预测）。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u53154858\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"ue9ddabf6\" data-lake-id=\"u5546f532\" id=\"u5546f532\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u29eef1a1\" id=\"u29eef1a1\">模型架构</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf16936d2\" id=\"uf16936d2\">： </span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E5%A4%9A%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%20%20%5Cnclass%20MultiTaskModel(nn.Module)%3A%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__init__(self%2C%20base_model)%3A%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20super().__init__()%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.base_model%20%3D%20base_model%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.task_heads%20%3D%20nn.ModuleList(%5B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%